sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as Angular CategoryChain facade
  participant Gate as HelixTauriImGate
  participant IM as Helix category_chain runtime
  participant Go as Go categorychain
  participant DB as SQLite category facts
  participant Sink as EventSink
  UI->>Gate: 读取服务端 card / mine / entries；计数与权限由服务端给出
  Gate->>IM: im_health 核对本地 feature 与 wire version 3
  Gate->>IM: im_category_chain_capabilities
  IM->>Go: POST /api/cses/post-chain/capabilities?mode=CATEGORY
  Go-->>IM: supported/schemaVersion
  IM-->>Gate: req_id 关联查询结果
  Gate->>IM: im_category_chain_get / get_mine / entries
  Note over Gate,IM: Host 转为 canonical category_chain_*；写返回 admission，读等待关联结果
  IM->>Go: POST /api/cses/post-chain/get；view=card / mine / entries；query 与 body mode=CATEGORY
  Go->>Go: 认证、可见性、权限、版本与业务校验
  Go-->>IM: Tick::PortReply 权威响应
  IM->>IM: 校验 scope/revision，准备权威文档
  opt 有新版本持久事实
    IM->>DB: PersistAtomic category_chain_head/fact 与相关事实
    DB-->>IM: matching PersistOk
  end
  IM->>DB: 读取对应持久版本
  DB-->>IM: PortReply readback
  IM->>Sink: 查询 im:read:result；写操作 im:category_chain:operation
  Sink-->>Gate: 按 req_id / mutation 结算
  Gate-->>UI: 绑定权威数据
  opt 服务端 WS 分类投影
    Go-->>IM: Tick::Inbound 分类权威变化
    IM->>DB: 匹配版本的持久化与读回屏障
    DB-->>IM: PortReply
    IM->>Sink: im:category_chain:projection
    Sink-->>UI: 更新分类卡片
  end
  Note over UI,Sink: 当前三仓已有实现；本轮仅源码核对，不宣称三端或本 Gate 真实验收 Green
